# Normalize all text files to LF. This repo currently has a CRLF/LF mix
# (e.g. docs/CHANGELOG-DESIGN.md, adr/README.md) -- this prevents new
# instances going forward. Existing files are not rewritten by this alone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: do not attempt line-ending normalization
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
